      "label": "Front-loading batch oven structural reference",
      "kind": "external",
      "source": "https://www.grievecorp.com/product-category/shelf-loading-ovens/shelf-ovens/",
      "description": "Front-loading shelf/batch enclosure and stationary product support informed the original generic artwork. No product dimensions, ratings or operating parameters were copied."
    }
  ],
